<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel"))>>
	"Your smuggler friend is annoyingly elusive. Got anything better?"
<<else>>
	"I still need to find Wren. Anything else you can tell me?"
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !$wrenSeen?.length>>
	Landry scratches <<his>> jaw. "Try the canal late in the day. <<nnpc_He "Wren">> moves product around dusk.
